WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.567 --> 00:00:02.534
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.534 --> 00:00:03.334
We hope you're doing well
tonight.

00:00:03.334 --> 00:00:04.200
Now, if you don't mind,

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:05.434
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.434 --> 00:00:07.300
President Biden criticized

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:09.801
Georgia Congresswoman Marjorie
Taylor Greene yesterday,

00:00:09.801 --> 00:00:12.834
and suggested that her politics
are causing Republicans

00:00:12.834 --> 00:00:14.367
to join the Democratic Party.

00:00:14.367 --> 00:00:16.467
Oh, come on,
we can't even get Democrats

00:00:16.467 --> 00:00:18.133
to join the Democratic Party.

00:00:18.133 --> 00:00:19.601
[ Laughter ]

00:00:19.601 --> 00:00:22.267
According to a new poll,
68% of voters said that

00:00:22.267 --> 00:00:24.701
President Biden is too old
for another term.

00:00:24.701 --> 00:00:27.634
I don't know. I mean, okay,
he's an 80-year-old man.

00:00:27.634 --> 00:00:29.167
But the job is mostly

00:00:29.167 --> 00:00:31.467
telling long stories
that don't go anywhere...

00:00:31.467 --> 00:00:32.734
[ Laughter ]

00:00:32.734 --> 00:00:36.133
...signing whatever
a young person hands you...

00:00:36.133 --> 00:00:38.901
and arguing with foreigners
and drug companies.

00:00:38.901 --> 00:00:41.734
Man for the job, I say.

00:00:41.734 --> 00:00:44.968
The House Foreign Affairs
committee voted yesterday

00:00:44.968 --> 00:00:46.367
to advance a bill

00:00:46.367 --> 00:00:48.467
that would allow
President Biden to ban TikTok.

00:00:48.467 --> 00:00:51.801
Ban it? He hasn't even
figured out how to download it.

00:00:51.801 --> 00:00:53.467
[ Laughter ]

00:00:53.467 --> 00:00:55.367
"Hello,
TikTok customer service?"

00:00:55.367 --> 00:00:57.801
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:57.801 --> 00:00:59.834
A spokesperson for
the Chinese Foreign Ministry

00:00:59.834 --> 00:01:02.334
said today that the U.S.
should cease weapon sales

00:01:02.334 --> 00:01:04.067
and military contact
with Taiwan.

00:01:04.067 --> 00:01:06.501
Oh, what are you going to do,
send another balloon?

00:01:06.501 --> 00:01:07.868
I'd like to see you try!

00:01:07.868 --> 00:01:10.400
[ Laughter ]
Oh, damn, that was fast, wow.

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:12.100
[ Laughter ]
It's right outside.

00:01:12.100 --> 00:01:15.934
Vermont Senator Bernie Sanders
recently released a new book

00:01:15.934 --> 00:01:18.501
titled "It's OK to be Angry
About Capitalism."

00:01:18.501 --> 00:01:21.234
And if you still don't believe
him, you can look at the price.

00:01:21.234 --> 00:01:24.968
[ Laughter ]
That's right.

00:01:24.968 --> 00:01:28.133
Bernie Sanders recently
released a new book titled

00:01:28.133 --> 00:01:30.200
"It's OK to be Angry About
Capitalism."

00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:32.934
And if you like that, check out
the rest of the books in his

00:01:32.934 --> 00:01:34.767
"It's OK to be Angry"
collection.

00:01:34.767 --> 00:01:37.000
[ Laughter ]

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:39.067
The Supreme Court
heard arguments yesterday

00:01:39.067 --> 00:01:41.400
in a dispute between
New York and New Jersey.

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:44.701
It was the case of "ayy!"
versus "oooh!"

00:01:44.701 --> 00:01:47.534
[ Laughter ]

00:01:47.534 --> 00:01:49.634
A very subtle...

00:01:49.634 --> 00:01:51.667
very subtle but real difference.

00:01:51.667 --> 00:01:53.434
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:53.434 --> 00:01:55.400
"The New York Times"
published a profile yesterday

00:01:55.400 --> 00:01:58.601
of a man who has
lived his life mostly barefoot

00:01:58.601 --> 00:01:59.834
for the past 20 years.

00:01:59.834 --> 00:02:02.234
And bad news,
he's on your flight.

00:02:02.234 --> 00:02:05.133
[ Laughter ]

00:02:05.133 --> 00:02:07.868
Producers have announced
that actress Bebe Neuwirth

00:02:07.868 --> 00:02:10.400
will return for the revival
of the sitcom "Frasier"

00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:12.300
to repr-- to reprise --
excuse me --

00:02:12.300 --> 00:02:13.734
her role as Lilith Sternin.

00:02:13.734 --> 00:02:15.801
Not returning, Eddie the dog.

00:02:15.801 --> 00:02:18.901
[ Audience aws ]

00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:25.767
Yeah, you guys thought you
didn't like that barefoot joke.

00:02:25.767 --> 00:02:27.167
[ Laughter ]

00:02:27.167 --> 00:02:29.300
You didn't realize that --
those were the heights.

00:02:29.300 --> 00:02:30.968
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:30.968 --> 00:02:33.033
Officials at a zoo in Nebraska
this week

00:02:33.033 --> 00:02:35.934
confirmed that a cheetah briefly
escaped from its enclosure.

00:02:35.934 --> 00:02:37.300
Oh, good, only briefly.

00:02:37.300 --> 00:02:39.701
It's just a cheetah.
How far could it have gotten?

00:02:39.701 --> 00:02:41.767
[ Laughter ]

00:02:44.334 --> 00:02:45.801
It was chasing Eddie.

00:02:45.801 --> 00:02:48.601
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:52.734
According to a new survey,
the Tooth Fairy now leaves

00:02:52.734 --> 00:02:54.801
more than $6 per tooth
on average,

00:02:54.801 --> 00:02:56.367
which explains
the recent increase

00:02:56.367 --> 00:02:58.167
in seven-year-olds
taking up hockey.

00:02:58.167 --> 00:03:00.567
[ Laughter ]

00:03:00.567 --> 00:03:03.200
And finally, a cruise line
is now accepting reservations

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:05.534
for the first ever
three-year-long cruise,

00:03:05.534 --> 00:03:06.968
two years with good behavior.

00:03:06.968 --> 00:03:08.267
And...

00:03:08.267 --> 00:03:09.868
that was the monologue,
everybody!

00:03:09.868 --> 00:03:10.968
We're off and running.

